      <div style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--primary-border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--primary-dim);font-size:12px;">
        <b style="color:var(--primary)">Active Model:</b> Google Gemini 3.6 Flash (`gemini-3.6-flash`). Calls are made directly to `generativelanguage.googleapis.com`.
      </div>

      <label style="font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text-heading);">
        <span>Google Gemini API Key</span>
